      <div class="entry-links">
        <a href="/projects/MycoPoetica - Karna, Abhishek - 2022.pdf" target="_blank">Read</a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="entry-title">Temples of South India and Cambodia, 2023 to 2024</div>
      <div>
        Field research on more than a hundred temples in South India and fifteen in Cambodia, and on the
        exchange between Dravidian and Khmer architecture.
      </div>
      <div class="entry-links">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g6quT1AjrTg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Trailer</a>
        <a href="/projects/Dravidian-Khmer Field Project - Karna, Abhishek - 2023_24.pdf" target="_blank">Poster</a>
